e can implement near-term solutions and plan for a just and smooth transition at the best possible time, minimizing financial and emotional impacts to the Long Beach community.", "short_description": "This experience was developed to illustrate the potential impacts of climate change on coastal communities and possible solutions. We hope this experience will help support the community\u2019s conversation about how to adapt to a changing climate. The goal of this project is to start a dialogue to ensure we can implement near-term solutions and plan for a just and smooth transition at the best possible time, minimizing financial and emotional impacts to the Long Beach community."}]}, "developer_name": "Virtual Planet Technologies LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualplanet.tech/privacy-policy-app", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.virtualplanet.tech/", "publisher_name": "Virtual Planet Technologies LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.virtualplanet.tech/", "website_url": "https://www.virtualplanet.tech/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD_VIA_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "466876864894618"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230052_442383290328036_4446212654123377333_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0